Hello. These are photos of the couch.
As you can see, there is some sun discoloration from when it sat against a south-facing window.
It takes well to a lint roller, the cushions are washable, and the style of fabric is great for cats;
unlike our previous couch, this one has been with 2 cats for 6 years and lived to tell the tale.

